最简单的办法：直接用Socks5，Python支持，在PowerShell里：

$env:ALL_PROXY = "socks5://127.0.0.1:10808"
$env:HTTPS_PROXY = "socks5://127.0.0.1:10808"
$env:HTTP_PROXY = "socks5://127.0.0.1:10808"

